<header><a class="back-link" href="/customers">← Customers</a><h1>Account deletion</h1><p>The existing deletion worker performs and verifies the approved removal.</p></header><section class="card"><h2><%= removal.status==='COMPLETED'?'Account deleted':job?.status==='DEAD'?'Removal stopped for review':job?.status==='RUNNING'?'Removing the reviewed account':'Removal queued' %></h2><% if(removal.status==='COMPLETED'){ %><p>The sign-in account and its reviewed businesses were removed. The email is available for a new registration.</p><% }else if(job?.last_error){ %><p><%= ownerFormat.text(job.last_error) %></p><p>Review the account’s current state before preparing a new request. Nothing should be repeated blindly.</p><% }else{ %><p>This page can be refreshed safely; it does not submit another deletion.</p><a class="button secondary" href="<%= currentPath %>">Refresh status</a><% } %><a class="button" href="/customers">Back to customers</a></section>
